{"id":"n62449-1-22","stage":3,"title":"인생 · 人生","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62449-1-22-1","ko":"일은 그만하고 술이나 한잔하러 가자.","zh":"别工作了，咱们去喝点酒吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일은","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일은","audio":"/audio/b9e5f14a07245bf00ebf.mp3"}},{"text":"그만하고","meaning":"停止，停","explanation":"그만하다：停止，停；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그만하다","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37072","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만하고","audio":"/audio/a4ec1ecfa14dbb2aad18.mp3"}},{"text":"술이나","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술이나","audio":"/audio/bf58d092838b75f8f653.mp3"}},{"text":"한잔하러","meaning":"喝一杯","explanation":"한잔하다：喝一杯；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"한잔하다","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62372","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한잔하러","audio":"/audio/9b17e9835863c90fda21.mp3"}},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자","audio":"/audio/9d6a16e0f490c47dce42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"129344a9c4625793","term":"그만하다","zh":"停止，停","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3","entryId":"37072","definition":"停住正在做的事。","pronunciation":["그만하다"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"0daf602b903f5088","term":"한잔하다","zh":"喝一杯","audio":"/audio/0daf602b903f50885a5b.mp3","entryId":"62372","definition":"稍微喝一场茶、酒等。","pronunciation":["한잔하다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06489b685715e35d0620.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62449-1-22-2","ko":"그래, 짧은 인생인데 즐길 때는 즐길 줄 알아야지.","zh":"对啊，人生苦短，该享受的时候就得好好享受。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"짧은","meaning":"短","explanation":"짧다：短；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"짧다","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71363","senseId":"2","lemma":"짧다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짧은","audio":"/audio/4eb5ee7c900ba65a43e0.mp3"}},{"text":"인생인데","meaning":"人生","explanation":"인생：人生；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"인생","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62449","senseId":"1","lemma":"인생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인생인데","audio":"/audio/f2df4c0ee040bbf8cb43.mp3"}},{"text":"즐길","meaning":"享受","explanation":"즐기다：享受；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"즐기다","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entry